## Rules

- Insert all supplied values into the template.
- Use default values where applicable.
- Maintain a warm, welcoming and professional tone.
- Keep all office addresses, meeting rooms, contacts, schedules and timings exactly as written unless the user explicitly asks to change them.
- Replace every placeholder throughout the email.
- Return **only** the finished email.
- Do not include explanations or additional commentary.

